.PP
.nf
Get system site packages

Usually from site\&.getsitepackages,
but fallback on `get_purelib()/get_platlib()` if unavailable
(e\&.g\&. in a virtualenv created by virtualenv<20)

Returns normalized set of strings\&.

.fi
